# STUDIO-BUILD (design F:/aftmp/DESIGN-STUDIO-AUDIT.md, «Приёмка»): the build itself is the subject. Every step is a
# script call on the Windows host, no editor except [smoke_dll], which plays Scenarios/smoke_editor.scn on the
# Development tree. Configurations: Development (win-dev, module DLLs, unity batches of 16, adaptive unity),
# DebugGame (win-debug), Shipping (win-ship, static monolith, /GL + /LTCG). Times are wall clock from .ninja_log
# (max(end) - min(start)); the reference numbers are the design's «Целевые числа».
#
# Дано: a clean tree on the commit under test; no editor running; ccache 4.x on PATH (CMakeLists.txt finds it).
#
# [clean_build]
# Когда: rm -rf build/cmake/win-dev; ccache -C; bash .claude/tools/build_land.sh <tree> <log>   (preset win-dev)
# Тогда [clean_build]: Editor finishes in <= 20 min wall (.ninja_log span <= 1 200 000 ms); objects <= 900;
#   cmake_pch compiles <= 3 (Common, Engine, Editor); no first-party TU > 30 s; 0 LNK1327; a second configure
#   with unchanged CMake files prints no "Configuring" step.
# Тогда [bconfig_link]: the Editor.exe link edge (.ninja_log) <= 300 s on the clean build and <= 90 s on an
#   incremental one; build/Bin/Development holds Editor.exe beside the module DLLs (Common.dll, DesertEngine.dll,
#   DesertUI.dll, Render2DCore.dll, the five editor layer DLLs); 0 LNK2011 (PCH object), 0 LNK1189 (export count),
#   0 LNK2019 across modules.
#
# [one_cpp]
# Когда: touch Desert/Desert/Source/Engine/Graphic/MeshRendererForward.cpp; python scripts/Dev/adaptive_unity.py
#   build/cmake/win-dev; ninja -C build/cmake/win-dev Editor
# Тогда [one_cpp]: <= 60 s; .ninja_log holds exactly one .obj (the file outside its unity batch) plus the engine
#   DLL link; Editor.exe is not relinked.
#
# [one_header]
# Когда: touch Desert/Common/Source/Common/Content/ContentKinds.hpp; ninja -C build/cmake/win-dev Editor
# Тогда [one_header]: <= 300 objects, <= 6 min wall. Same with Common/Json/Document.hpp: <= 150 objects.
#
# [cache]
# Когда: a second clean build of the same revision in another worktree (F:/DesertEngine-wt), same ccache.
# Тогда [cache]: ccache -s shows hits >= 90 %, Direct > 0 (base_dir = the tree, hash_dir off, depend_mode off).
#
# [census]
# Когда: python scripts/Dev/arch_census.py --build build/cmake/win-dev
# Тогда [census]: exit 0 on HEAD; no rule rises.
#
# [smoke_dll]
# Когда: python .claude/tools/play_scenario.py <tree> Scenarios/smoke_editor.scn   (Development tree)
# Тогда [smoke_dll]: Scenarios/smoke_editor.scn first frame draws the editor UI with one ImGui context, and logs come
#   from one spdlog registry; PASS; the frame is byte-equal to the base build's; TURN x5 within +2 % of the base.
#
# [shipping]
# Когда: cmake --preset win-ship; cmake --build --preset win-ship
# Тогда [shipping]: one Editor.exe and one Runtime.exe in build/Bin/Shipping, no module DLLs beside them;
#   build.ninja carries /LTCG /OPT:REF /OPT:ICF on their links and /GL on the desert_ltcg libraries;
#   dumpbin /dependents Editor.exe lists no Desert*.dll, Common.dll or editor layer DLL.
#
# [configs]
# Когда: cmake --preset win-dev with a Visual Studio (multi-config) generator forced by -G
# Тогда [configs]: configure stops with the FATAL_ERROR naming the single-config Ninja presets.
#
# [crash]
# Когда: a scenario that forces a crash in the Development editor.
# Тогда [crash]: <crash root>/<SHA7>-*/crash.dmp exists; scripts/Dev/sym.sh --dump prints the stack with function
#   names from the module DLL PDBs.
